# Definition of Done

Project is complete when:

1. User uploads ALT log files.
2. Files are grouped automatically by device.
3. Timeline is reconstructed automatically.
4. All records are decoded correctly.
5. Battery trend is visualized.
6. Register stability is verified.
7. EEPROM/Flash failures are highlighted.
8. Reports are generated automatically.
9. Entire application runs locally.
10. Startup time < 3 seconds.
11. Processing time < 5 seconds for 100 devices.
12. Memory usage remains below 250MB.